WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
Jumping heavy kick connects from the forward jump.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.300
Back heavy punch follows the jump-in.

3
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.000
OD Renversé’s Grand Fouetté kick follow-up launches Ryu.

4
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.650
Back heavy punch catches Ryu after the launch.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.350
Heavy Rond-point continues the juggle.

6
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.700
Light Renversé catches the falling opponent.

7
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.550
The final hit grab raises Manon from one medal to two.
